WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.915 --> 00:00:03.600
- There's nothing leisurely
about competitive eating,

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:05.674
this is an aerobic activity.

00:00:05.674 --> 00:00:08.759
It's like running a marathon
and a hundred yard dash

00:00:08.759 --> 00:00:11.648
at the same time except
your feet are standing still

00:00:11.648 --> 00:00:15.288
but your stomach is moving
at 100 miles an hour.

00:00:15.288 --> 00:00:17.671
(quick classical music)

00:00:17.671 --> 00:00:19.447
My name's Crazy Legs Conti.

00:00:19.447 --> 00:00:23.287
I've been a major league
eater for 15 years.

00:00:23.287 --> 00:00:25.353
I cannot think of a single food

00:00:25.353 --> 00:00:29.193
that has not gone
competitively into my stomach.

00:00:29.193 --> 00:00:32.376
Make no mistake, competitive
eating is a real sport.

00:00:32.376 --> 00:00:33.730
It's muscle memory.

00:00:33.730 --> 00:00:36.821
Your stomach, mind and body has it

00:00:36.821 --> 00:00:39.404
if you've prepared well enough.

00:00:40.332 --> 00:00:44.040
What can go wrong are not
the voices in your stomach

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:45.633
(fast pop music crashes to silence)

00:00:45.633 --> 00:00:48.140
but the voices in your head.

00:00:48.140 --> 00:00:50.378
"You're getting full, the
contest is going forever,

00:00:50.378 --> 00:00:51.738
when will this end?"

00:00:51.738 --> 00:00:53.706
Your strategy has to be spot on

00:00:53.706 --> 00:00:55.624
in terms of your technique.

00:00:55.624 --> 00:00:58.791
But you don't actually taste the food.

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:03.243
At about 15, I start to feel the drag

00:01:04.185 --> 00:01:06.435
on pestoly-is in my system.

00:01:07.413 --> 00:01:09.613
In competitive eating we call it the wall,

00:01:09.613 --> 00:01:13.361
that's where your body just says stop.

00:01:13.361 --> 00:01:15.603
You're sweating, your
cheeks are puffed out,

00:01:15.603 --> 00:01:17.430
you're exhausted.

00:01:17.430 --> 00:01:19.207
The last two minutes are
where dreams are made

00:01:19.207 --> 00:01:20.473
and realities are broken.

00:01:20.473 --> 00:01:23.419
That's the most difficult
part of any contest.

00:01:23.419 --> 00:01:25.667
(bongo drum music)

00:01:25.667 --> 00:01:28.848
There is no magic in the
aftermath of competitive eating.

00:01:28.848 --> 00:01:31.287
We digest everything we eat.

00:01:31.287 --> 00:01:33.438
I need to continually drink liquids

00:01:33.438 --> 00:01:37.416
to kind of create a log flume-like ability in my system.

00:01:37.416 --> 00:01:38.543
The minimum for any competitive eating

00:01:38.543 --> 00:01:41.793
contest is 24 hours before I feel human

00:01:42.953 --> 00:01:46.319
and by human I mean as
a casual diner again.

00:01:46.319 --> 00:01:47.681
I find the activity of competitive eating

00:01:47.681 --> 00:01:51.848
to be grueling and challenging
and esoteric but rewarding.

00:01:53.012 --> 00:01:54.370
I'm gonna eat for the rest of my life,

00:01:54.370 --> 00:01:56.804
I might as well do it competitively.

00:01:56.804 --> 00:01:59.971
(whimsical pop music)

